      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GANDHI MAIL (11) was a beaten favourite from this barrier last start but still performed well for second. Has recorded two wins and two placings from his last four attempts here and is suited back to a distance where he has won five of eight tries. Can go one better. An early break proved costly for LONDON TO A BRICK (10) when resuming but the hitout may have taken some of the freshness out of him. His best form is well up to winning this. YOUR MAJESTY (7) was fourth from a 20m handicap last time but had placed from behind the mobile in her other two starts this time in and should be hitting her peak now. ZENITH STRIDE (1) raced wide and worked last start but should enjoy better favours from this draw and has claims off a win from a much wider barrier here two back.",
